<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA 225-7 IN 50 OVERS V SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 225-7 IN 50 OVERS V SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>India scored 225 for seven in their 50 overs in the Independence Cup match against Sri Lanka on Saturday.</p>
